WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.015
LaunchKit: Next.js SaaS source code. Pay once, own it.

2
00:00:05.015 --> 00:00:10.517
The live demo: pick a role. No sign-up, no email.

3
00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:17.627
1/7 Dashboard: a real multi-tenant app with plan, AI usage and recent activity.

4
00:00:17.627 --> 00:00:28.361
2/7 Metered AI: a streaming chat. Every message is counted against the plan quota.

5
00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:36.694
3/7 Invitations and roles. In the demo, emails are captured instead of sent.

6
00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:45.780
4/7 Switch to Viewer: the Invite button disappears, and the server refuses too.

7
00:00:45.829 --> 00:00:49.875
5/7 Tenant isolation: try to open another customer's organization.

8
00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:55.912
5/7 It returns 404. Outsiders cannot even confirm the organization exists.

9
00:00:55.912 --> 00:01:01.447
6/7 Billing needs the Owner role, so switch back.

10
00:01:01.451 --> 00:01:07.997
6/7 Stripe and Razorpay behind one interface. Test mode only.

11
00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:15.555
7/7 Audit log, filtered to today: every action from the tour is recorded.

12
00:01:15.555 --> 00:01:20.560
That's the tour. Buy LaunchKit once and own the code.

